  ('ai:ai-batch-03:0e3822c1f2ee','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does Hana''s family do at Newroz?',array['They have a picnic in the mountains.','They go to the beach.','They stay at home.','They go to school.']::text[],'A','''We go to the mountains and have a picnic.''',array['kurdistan','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-03','My name is Hana. I live in Erbil. Erbil is the capital city of the Kurdistan Region. In the centre of the city there is a very old citadel on a hill. In March we celebrate Newroz. We go to the mountains and have a picnic with our family.',null,null,null),
